<section id="fileManagerApp" class="file-manager-loader"><div id="reic-filemanager-app" class="reic-fm" data-reic-category="file-manager"><header class="reic-fm-head"><div><small>VMDESKTOPREIC · OS MEDIA VM · CENTRAL SYSTEM FILES</small><h2>FILE MANAGER REIC</h2><p>Pusat folder, berkas sistem, komponen, layout, registri, dan tema desktop.</p></div><b class="reic-fm-runtime">REIC RUNTIME</b></header><div class="reic-fm-tools"><input id="reic-fm-search" type="search" placeholder="Cari kategori, folder, komponen, atau ekstensi…" aria-label="Cari file dan kategori"><button type="button" data-fm-refresh>MUAT ULANG</button></div><div class="reic-fm-summary" id="reic-fm-summary"></div><div class="reic-fm-layout"><nav aria-label="Kategori File Manager"><b>KATEGORI SISTEM</b><div id="reic-fm-nav">Memuat kategori…</div><b class="reic-fm-theme-label">TEMA KOMPONEN</b><div id="reic-fm-themes"></div></nav><main><div id="reic-fm-tabs" class="reic-fm-tabs"></div><div id="reic-fm-content" aria-live="polite">Memuat katalog…</div></main></div><footer><span id="reic-fm-count">MEMUAT INDEKS</span><span>.REIC · .REICSS · .REICJS · .REICG</span></footer></div></section>